OL,3,GNEWSATrusts pay #200k each to
OL,4,Aconsultants to reduce care package
OL,5,Acosts
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo health trusts in Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fpaid hundreds of thousands of pounds to
OL,9,Fa private consultancy firm to help them
OL,10,Freduce care package costs.
OL,12,FFreedom of Information requests show
OL,13,Fthe Northern Trust and South Eastern
OL,14,FTrust each paid more than #200,000 to
OL,15,FLiaison Care, which reviews high-cost
OL,16,Fcases.
OL,18,FOther trusts refused to reveal details
OL,19,Fof the contracts and the amount of
OL,20,Fpublic money paid to Liaison Care due
OL,21,Fto "commercial sensitivities".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
