OL,3,GNEWSATrusts pay #200k each to
OL,4,Aconsultants to reduce care package
OL,5,Acosts
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC News NI can also reveal that
OL,8,FDepartment of Health officials
OL,9,Fpreviously raised concerns about a
OL,10,Fpotential lack of oversight of the
OL,11,Fcompany because it carried out its
OL,12,Fonline assessments remotely.
